#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:548
msgid "WSB HUB3 is the free plugin for Croatian HUB-3 bank transfer payments. WSB PayByCode for WooCommerce is a separate paid plugin for SEPA bank transfers, including Croatian payments. It replaces WSB HUB3; it is not an add-on and the two plugins are not intended to run together."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:549
msgid "What WSB PayByCode offers"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:551
msgid "Local generation, privacy and GDPR"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:551
msgid "Payment codes are generated on your server. The customer and payment details needed to create them are not sent to an external barcode service, reducing third-party processing and giving you more control over personal data in the context of GDPR."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:552
msgid "No network wait for code generation"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:552
msgid "Code generation avoids sending data over the network and waiting for a barcode API response. Actual generation time still depends on your server."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:553
msgid "Independence from an external barcode service"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:553
msgid "Generating payment codes does not depend on the availability, rate limits or response times of a third-party barcode service."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:554
msgid "HUB-3 and SEPA payments"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:554
msgid "Use HUB-3 for Croatian payments and EPC QR codes for supported SEPA payments. Scanning EPC QR codes requires a banking app that supports the format."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:555
msgid "Bank accounts by country and currency"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:555
msgid "Manage bank accounts with rules by country and currency, with an optional account choice at checkout."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:556
msgid "Payment follow-up and practical tools"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:556
msgid "Set up payment reminders and automatic cancellation of unpaid orders, offer copy buttons for payment details, include codes in WP Overnight PDF invoices, and translate custom text with Polylang or WPML."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:558
msgid "The privacy benefit applies to payment code generation. License activation and update checks communicate separately with the licensing and update service. Local generation alone does not guarantee GDPR compliance."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:559
msgid "Requirements and license"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:560
msgid "Requires PHP 8.2+, WordPress 6.5+ and WooCommerce 9.0+."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:561
msgid "The paid license includes one year of updates and email support. The installed plugin's features continue to work after the license expires."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:562
msgid "Switching from WSB HUB3"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:564
msgid "Back up your site, then deactivate WSB HUB3 without deleting its settings."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:565
